I(77,'idea of the earlier run',[(33,155,251,251)],'en utilisant un sous-espace partout dense bien choisi de H','In real H=l²(N₀), take x=e₀ and G=span{e_n+ne₀:n≥1}. G is dense and excludes e₀; σ(H,G) is Hausdorff, agrees with weak topology on the unit ball, but has no continuous supporting hyperplane there at e₀.','This realizes the source sketch and does not recover the absent original conjecture.','Density follows from (e_n+ne₀)/n→e₀; separation and uniqueness of the norming functional complete the check.')
